      "raw_text": "[6:10p.m.] #Obalende #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic coming from Osborne and OBalende is good but slow approaching Ilubirin as traffic Funnels through the Ilubirin Merging point.\n\nTraffic is better as you move towards Adeniji and then the Third Mainland Bridge.\n\n@jidesanwoolu @drobafemihamzat @seunosiyemi_ @Sola_Giwa @walemusa @Mr_JAGs @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @lagostelevision @followlasg",
      "cleaned_text": "[6:10p.m.] #Obalende #TrafficUpdate Traffic coming from Osborne and OBalende is good but slow approaching Ilubirin as traffic Funnels through the Ilubirin Merging point. Traffic is better as you move towards Adeniji and then the Third Mainland Bridge.",
